<title>INDIA: India Wipro sets 2:1 bonus shr ratio.</title>
<headline>India Wipro sets 2:1 bonus shr ratio.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1997-08-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>India's Wipro Ltd. set a bonus ratio of two  shares for each one held, a company official told Reuters on Friday.</p>
